Blackline is a private police company in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] that sells its protection by subscription. Its officers wear full uniforms and carry batons at their sides. They keep to the wealthier quarters of the city, so their presence in a district like [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/index|Sableclutch]] stands out.

Two of their officers, a talkative man named Smith and his silent partner Mute, patrol near [[Org/Sableclutch Scrap/index|Sableclutch Scrap]]. Creatures that wear the shapes of men have been found carrying what appear to be genuine Blackline badges inside their flesh.
